{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_totter_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_totter_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"歸鄉","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_totter_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"41a0f91b4547e6ad1e7166f5dd2e57ada10883d376b23a4d7653e0137f107732","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"這一切都始自公司的廁所，那天我在馬桶上嚎啕大哭，為自己一團亂的人生感到絕望。\n隔間外，幾位剛從薩爾貢度假回來的同事聊起了自己的假日時光，從他們口中我聽到了一個名字，與一段讓我平靜下來的妙論。\n於是，我背起行囊，歷盡艱辛，從哥倫比亞的鋼鐵叢林到薩爾貢的茂密雨林，最終抵達此地，見到了那位智者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎來到靜修之地，怎麼樣，你今天見到智者了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非常榮幸，雖然見到智者時已經很晚了，但他還是耐心傾聽了我的問題，並為我解答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"他怎麼說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他用行動代替了言語，默默地捲著自己手上的繩索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"……繩索？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，智者是想告訴我，煩惱如亂麻，但只要耐心以對，就能將其編織為一根根繩索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後它們自然就會柔順地盤繞在手心，不再讓人頭痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"咳……有道理，很有道理，不愧是智者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，你的悟性也很高，能夠迅速領悟智者言行舉止間所蘊含的真理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，分別時，智者還滿含深意地看了我一眼，我想，這正是他對我的讚許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"對，你說得對……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，一開始，我還以為這次的心靈之旅只是傳得誇張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我們跟從智者指引，從不會欺騙他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，我今天會帶著滿足睡去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"那就祝你有個好夢吧，先生。明天的講座將在早上八點準時開始，屆時將由我帶領大家前往會場。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_falls_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……人們獨自走過自己的一生……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"猶如泛孤舟於湖面……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"瀑布下，智者盤坐在湖中央的巨石上，為湖邊眾人講述著他從潺潺流水中獲得的哲思，語調和緩。\n眾人凝神，感受著溫和的話語如同流水般浸潤內心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，朋友，你來多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天才來，你呢？來多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"已經快一個月了，想不到吧，一個月前我還沉浸在上一段感情的陰影中，頹廢異常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你現在看著容光煥發……哦，肯定是智者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是他帶領我走出了悲痛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"聽到人群中的談論，智者停頓片刻，看向遠方，向眾人展露笑容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，智者往我這邊看了！我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"哦……智者的眼睛是多麼溫柔，好像能療癒我內心的苦悶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我感覺……在他那迷離的、充滿仁愛與理解的目光中，我將與周遭萬物達成和解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要意識到發生在我們身上的種種就像我們身邊的流水……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……終究只是匆匆而過，不會停留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玻利瓦爾旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！是那個動作，智者的招牌動作，他向眾人伸出了手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！他要說出那句話了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼？！智者要說什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"別急！他馬上就會講了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放下對生活的期待……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"各國旅人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"任流水帶我去遠方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_falls_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"托特爾，你中間停了一下，為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽到人群中有聲音，所以停下來看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，是哪個傢伙不專心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，沒戴眼鏡看不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……下次講座可以換個地方嗎？水邊蚊子太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，也沒下次了，按照我們的劇本，你馬上就要退居幕後了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……總算要結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧你，我們這幾個月靠遊客賺了不少錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，要不是這幾年過得實在太潦倒，我們也不至於為難你一個病患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，離開家鄉這麼久，兩手空空地回來，說實在真有些對不起大家……能幫著大家找到一個發財之路也蠻好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟父親離開後，是鄉親們為我湊齊路費，如今也該換我報答大家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"說來也真是不好意思，打擾了你最後的平靜生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也沒有預料到順手救下那個旅遊團會帶來這麼多麻煩。誰知道他們回去後亂講了什麼，突然某天就有一堆人找上門來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，乍聽之下還以為是村子裡出了個大人物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"順著他們的話說了一陣子後，才明白他們找的人是你，本來還打算繼續編些故事從他們手裡賺點情報費的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你這個騙錢的計劃從那時就有雛形了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是講了他們想聽的話而已，順著別人心意講話可是要技巧的，收點錢又怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（瞇眼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，比起移動城市的心理諮詢師，確實也沒收多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"給你的報酬為什麼要退回來，那可是很大一筆錢，你就沒有什麼想要的東西了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒……我只想平靜地度過接下來的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你像河水般接納投入其中的所有事物，自會流向遠方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這不是明天劇本裡的台詞嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，看來你已經看過劇本了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我與智者同行的時間是如此短暫。\n在雨林裡停留半個月後，他突然向所有人宣布，要離開大家，開始一段新的旅程，去往一個全新的地方。\n他宣布了自己的死訊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_falls_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，這是有什麼急事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我也並不知情，智者只是讓我通知大家聚集在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，您不早點告訴我，我還穿著自己的睡衣呢……這樣衣衫不整去見智者多冒犯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"無妨無妨，智者本人不拘小節，不會在意這些的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，看……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"茂密的雨林中，幾隻角獸緩緩走出，在瀑布邊駐足。片刻後，又有更多動物走出雨林，聚在岸邊。\n一條鱗躍出水面，激起的水紋卻久久不散。\n隨即，眾人發現，河水早已靜止，甚至從懸崖傾瀉而下的水簾也不再流動。\n而智者從水簾後緩緩走出，身著素衣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"諸位，久等了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"話音剛落，河水再次流動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"智者！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎，你別一直往前擠啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次我一定要靠近一點，讓智者看到我支持他的模樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"智者，天才剛亮，您要和我們講什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天晚上，我在叢林夜遊的時候，看到星光從樹葉的間隙灑下，落在湖面上，我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……諸位……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那裡我看到了自己生命的盡頭……呼喚你們來到這裡，只是想與大家告別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"您是在開玩笑嗎，智者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"荒謬至極，智者從來不開玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玻利瓦爾旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"智者，難道您能預知自己的未來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未來與過去不過是一條河流的兩段，只要身處河水中，自然就能從水面蕩起的波紋中解讀出遠方傳來的訊息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但窺見自己的命運是要付出代價的，我感覺到自己正在被此地排斥，在這世間的旅途也即將走到盡頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"智者……面對死亡，您為何這樣無動於衷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在離開前，我早已接受自己的結局，尋覓到了內心的平靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"諸位也不要為我傷心，死亡對我來說，不過是另一段旅程，另一段修行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，您的面龐，看起來是多麼寧靜……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早已對歷經的一切釋懷，正如河水接納投入其中的所有事物，然後兀自流向遠方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玻利瓦爾旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"智者，在您離開前，可否告訴我您是如何解讀這一切的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天機不可洩露。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“智者”","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別了，諸位……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_aerialview"},{"type":"narration","text":"一隻羽獸落在智者的肩膀，他閉上雙眼，垂下頭，好似進入深眠。\n在他腳下，河水急速流動，形成漩渦。\n水花高高濺起，再一眨眼，智者便沉入漩渦中心了。\n只留下一個小小漩渦，在湖面靜靜旋轉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在哥倫比亞，我是個失敗的傢伙，不僅破產，家庭也瀕臨破碎，但此次旅行令我找回了重新面對生活的勇氣。\n智者面對死亡時的豁達與超脫令我深信，總會有一條河流帶走我曾經的傷痛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪……這好像不是約定好的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那傢伙是怎麼挖水道的？真是的，竟然拐到這裡來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"智者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"河水緩緩流過，正如時光在……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都懂的，您不必說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會說出去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道嗎？我的真實身分其實是僱傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……放心好了，要說的話我早就說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從第一天來到這裡後，我就察覺到不對了，那些淺顯的大道理其實很難打動誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你們看起來並無異議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……為什麼要有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡風景不錯，吃得很好，扮演智者的人也很好看——就是老兄你啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更重要的是，這裡花費不高，大家都覺得來度假很划算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我每次表演，你們都很投入，就像是對此深信不疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好吧，我一直把它當作景點特色體驗來玩的，之前在龍門我也玩過，不過那時扮演的角色是黑幫小弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還沒有去過龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以去看看，蠻好玩的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想應該沒有什麼機會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心好了，都是看破不說破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家來到這裡稍微喘口氣，短暫地逃避現實生活中的煩惱，誰會在乎是真是假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正最後我們都要回到那條屬於我們自己的河流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像智者說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞旅人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，就像智者說的，我們的煩惱在那裡，我們的牽掛也在那裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert03_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"托特爾，其實……如果你想留在辦事處也可以，羅德島有非常完備的臨終關懷計劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很感激，但我還是想在家鄉度過人生最後的時光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"但你不是說聯絡不到在家鄉的家人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊，因為他們都過世了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那你回去豈不是要孤身一人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"……哪裡好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個人很安靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身邊人的憐憫和悲傷會讓我感到煩惱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"拿去，乾衣服，趕快換上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼現在才過來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你們找不到其他辦法了嗎？從瀑布游到這裡並不近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"另一個方案是讓你隨著紛飛的羽獸一起消失，不過有個缺點，就是會全身沾滿羽獸糞便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那算了，還不如這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望我離開後，這場謝幕仍能一直為這裡吸引源源不斷的旅客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"其實……雨林這麼大，我們絕對能找到一處平靜的居所供你休息，你沒必要離開的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我保證，來往的旅客不會打擾到你安寧自在的日子，至於衣食住行的花費，大家來出，你需要什麼說一聲就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，我還是打算離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"或許在大家眼裡我是個油嘴滑舌的傢伙，但你和我一起長大，我不會騙你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，知道，我又不傻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"……那為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"智者說的是對的，我應當去尋找一條真正能夠接納我，且使我感到平靜的河流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"智者不就是你自己？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是，我只是扮演他的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"智者侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，他說的話可都是我亂寫的，托特爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無所謂，反正我過日子也是隨便亂來的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"智者是否真實存在並不重要，但有一件事是肯定的。\n人們總是會有煩惱與牽絆，只有接受這一切，才能讓人真正平靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我想我已經準備好重新面對未來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"算算時間……托特爾回家鄉已經半年多了，再過半年，我們一起找個時間去看看他吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗨……那個……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"托特爾？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……出了一些事情，原定計劃改變了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之我回來了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那你現在……打算是……不是……我腦袋有點亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，既然你回來了，那我就沒必要去雨林裡找你了，之前有封你的信寄到這裡來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……給我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從哪裡寄來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"雪原。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"誰寄來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托特爾","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……我想，應該是一些以前的朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
